(ftruncate = 46)
.br
.bd
(descriptor in hl)
.br
.bd
sys; ftruncate; length_low; length_high


.in -5
.bd
RETURNS
.in +5
.br
The carry flag is cleared on success, or set on failure.
On failure the error number is returned in hl.
